OL,3,GNEWSAStates asked to support young
OL,4,Atenants at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States has been asked to provide
OL,7,F#57,000 to help give young, vulnerable
OL,8,Fpeople a start in life as they take on
OL,9,Ftheir first tenancy in Guernsey.
OL,11,FThe grant would be used to help Action
OL,12,Ffor Children provide support services
OL,13,Ffor people living at seven new flats in
OL,14,Fa property in St Peter Port.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
