OL,3,GNEWSAStates asked to support young
OL,4,Atenants at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity has secured #2m in grants
OL,7,Fand Deputy Steve Williams said the
OL,8,Fgovernment money would support "young
OL,9,Fpeople in those properties in helping
OL,10,Fwith life skills, getting on the
OL,11,Fstraight and narrow and sustaining
OL,12,Ftheir tenancy and getting into the big
OL,13,Fwide world".
OL,15,FHe said it was essential as the service
OL,16,Fwould stop without the funding for the
OL,17,Ftenants, 60% of whom had been in care.
